{
  // X-Tension's stations: shipyards, docks, trading stations and every factory variant.
  // games/xbtf has its own; the two executables list different stations.
  //
  // Every field but the X-Tension prices, recipes and cycles is the executable's own data, from the
  // station records it keeps beside the ships — regenerate them with
  //     dotnet run --project tools/OpenXt.AssetImport -- stations --game xtension --json
  // Station statistics are facts about the game, not copyrighted assets, so they live here; meshes,
  // textures and the games' text never do.
  //
  // xbtfSceneId names the station's scene, cut/0NNNN.pbd in the archive: the multi-part model
  // that places its bodies and lights. xbtfBodyId is its main body. product is the ware a factory makes
  // (the record's text id + 2); the ware ids are wares/wares.json's.
  //
  // Race is not stored and is recovered by openxt-import: from the name for shipyards, docks and
  // trading stations; from the scene id, which falls in per-race blocks (Teladi 4000-4017, Argon
  // 4018-4035, Boron 4036-4052, Split 4053-4065, Paranid 4066-4078, later ones listed in
  // StationCommands); and for factories beyond those blocks, from the fixed row order of their five
  // variants (Argon, Split, Paranid, Boron, Teladi). Wherever two rules apply they agree.
  //
  // hull is the record's per-variant value in the slot ships use for hull; inferred, unconfirmed.
  //
  // price, output, inputs and cycleSeconds come from elite-games.ru's X-Tension factory table
  // (factories.shtml, game version 2.0), since the executable's records hold no production data.
  // One cycle turns the inputs into output units of the product. The site lists factories by the
  // territory they stand in, joined here as their race; 122 of its 126 rows match a station (two
  // are repeats, and two Space Fuel Distilleries stand in Teladi space while the executable makes
  // the distillery Argon). Stations with no row have no price or recipe. Mines and solar power
  // plants have no fixed cycle (mines depend on the asteroid, power plants run 45-90 s), so their
  // cycleSeconds is absent.
  //
  // Left out: the "Unknown Object" prop filed among the stations.
  //
  // A mod changes this roster by layering its own data/stations/stations.json; entries merge by id.
